Cell[TextData[{
 "Now let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s solve the above equation in terms of A, B, C and \
D, so that we can relate each of A, B, C and D, i.e., the elements of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["M", "c2c"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "e6ba8463-3dae-4439-9c5a-bf68cdd1b8cf"],
 "and ",
