  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"0", ")"}], 
    StyleBox["T",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2e64ab54-4444-4eb7-beae-d5a8925d9bea"],
 ") in order to cancel the effect of both CSR and dispersion.).  This now \
gives us equations in terms of "
}], "Text",
