Cell["\<\
This is clearly not simpler.  The small angle approximation in this case does \
not give me what I want.  Instead let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s introduce some new \
variables.  First I want to confirm that the achromatic condition is \
fulfilled correctly for reasons that become clear later.  
\
\>", "Text",
